flowchart TD
    A["Existing route checks"] --> B["Resolve and validate bearer"]
    A -->|deny| X["Fixed caller-safe error"]
    B -->|invalid, failure, cancel| X
    B -->|valid exact bytes| C["HTTP through injected seam"]
    C --> D["Check status, body ceiling, Slack ok"]
    C -->|error or cancel| X
    D -->|reject| X
    D --> E["Strict UTF-8 decode"]
    E -->|invalid| W["Withhold body with safe notice"]
    E --> F["Filter JSON spans, then raw token"]
    F --> G["Check pre-truncation invariants"]
    F -->|cancel| X
    F -->|work bound or collision| W
    G -->|fail| W
    G --> H["Scalar-safe sanitized truncation"]
    H --> I["Final literal-token check"]
    I -->|fail| W
    I -->|pass| J["Safe response text"]
